{
  "abstract": "Formal Lean 4 fixed-quarter Brun–Titchmarsh-type estimate for nonnegative multiplicative weights without squarefree support, with a separate fixed B*n^(1/1280) growth witness. Includes the ordinary modulus-one short-interval corollary with a factor of nine in the bound, and a uniform upper-right parameter-quadrant consequence 1/4 <= alpha,beta < 1/2.",
